---
title: Pumpkin Bread
source: https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/6820/downeast-maine-pumpkin-bread/
cuisine: Desert
---

Preheat the oven to !350F. Grease and flour two 9x5-inch loaf pans, or line with parchment paper.

Mix @pumpkin puree{15 oz}, @eggs{4}, @oil{1 cup}, @water{2/3 cup}, and @sugar{3 cup} in a bowl until well blended.

Whisk @flour{3.5 cups}, @baking soda{2 tsp}, @salt{1.5 tsp}, @cinnamon{1 tsp}, @nutmeg{1 tsp}, @cloves{0.5 tps}, and @ginger {0.5 tsp} into the bowl.

Pour batter into the prepared pans.

Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted in center comes out clean, about ~{50 minutes}.
